msgid "Global Dimming Control"
msgstr "Globale dimming"

#: crates/sumi-gui/qml/OledCarePage.qml:81
msgid ""
"Lets the monitor adjust brightness across the whole panel for the content."
msgstr ""
"Laat de monitor de helderheid over het hele paneel aanpassen aan de inhoud."

